  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2705.02 Hearings. All administrative hearings held pursuant to Saf-C 2705.01 shall be conducted by the bureau of hearings pursuant to Saf-C 203.\n\nSource. #4976, eff 11-14-90; ss and moved by #6174, eff\n\n1-26-96 (from Saf-C 2702), EXPIRED: 1-26-04\n\nNew. #8073, eff 4-23-04; ss by #10084, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13214-A, eff 6-16-21\n\nAPPENDIX",
